   "en": "PROBLEM",
   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>钻井问题：</b>钻速慢，盲目增大钻压和转速又可能超限。</p><p><b>具体方法：</b>对数线性回归＋约束网格搜索；输入为钻压、转速、地层与排量。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>学习钻速响应，再筛选安全窗口内的高钻速组合。</p></div><p>钻压和转速的调整需要同时考虑地层响应与设备、井筒约束。仅追求更高的预测钻速，可能把推荐参数推到约束之外；只按固定参数钻进，又难以说明不同地层为何需要不同参数。</p><p>本例把这些关系简化成可调的合成模型，用同一套数据比较基准参数与约束内候选参数。下图仅说明“参数、响应与约束窗口”的关系，曲线与标记不是现场测量。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='参数与约束窗口的概念示意'><line x1='60' y1='210' x2='60' y2='26' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' marker-end='url(#arD1a)'/><line x1='60' y1='210' x2='668' y2='210' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' marker-end='url(#arD1a)'/><line x1='160' y1='206' x2='160' y2='214' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='310' y1='206' x2='310' y2='214' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='460' y1='206' x2='460' y2='214' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='610' y1='206' x2='610' y2='214' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><text x='160' y='226' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>40</text><text x='310' y='226' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>100</text><text x='460' y='226' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>160</text><text x='610' y='226' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>220</text><text x='660' y='242' font-size='9' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='end'>钻压 W (kN) →</text><line x1='54' y1='210' x2='66' y2='210' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='54' y1='150' x2='66' y2='150' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='54' y1='90' x2='66' y2='90' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='54' y1='30' x2='66' y2='30' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><text x='50' y='213' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='monospace'>0</text><text x='50' y='153' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='monospace'>15</text><text x='50' y='93' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='monospace'>30</text><text x='50' y='33' font-size='9' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='monospace'>45</text><text x='24' y='120' font-size='9' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle' transform='rotate(-90 24 120)'>机械钻速 (m/h)</text><path d='M160,210 C230,190 280,176 310,170 C370,157 420,136 460,124 C510,110 580,88 660,56' fill='none' stroke='#202b38' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='310' y1='40' x2='310' y2='206' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='560' y1='40' x2='560' y2='206' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><text x='185' y='52' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>① 清岩不足</text><text x='185' y='66' font-size='8.5' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>岩屑重复破碎</text><text x='435' y='46' font-size='10' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>② 有效破碎段</text><text x='435' y='60' font-size='8.5' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>优化目标区</text><text x='614' y='46' font-size='9' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>③ 约束区</text><text x='614' y='60' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>扭矩 · 钻压 · ECD</text><circle cx='410' cy='133' r='4.5' fill='#64748b'/><line x1='410' y1='133' x2='382' y2='102' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1' marker-end='url(#arD1a)'/><text x='378' y='96' font-size='9' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='end'>基准参数点（示意）</text><path d='M542,58 L546,66 L555,67 L548,73 L550,82 L542,77 L534,82 L536,73 L529,67 L538,66 Z' fill='#2875c7'/><text x='542' y='95' font-size='9.5' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>窗口内候选点（示意）</text><defs><marker id='arD1a' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#9ba3a9'/></marker></defs></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>原理示意</b><span>曲线、参数点和窗口为概念图；示范中的最优候选由当前合成模型与约束设置计算，不能从本图读取实际钻速。</span></div>"
