   "no": 2,
   "en": "INTERVENTION",
   "title": "具体智能化方法与服务路径",
   "html": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 720 112' role='img' aria-label='对数线性回归＋约束网格搜索'><g font-family='system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif'><rect x='8' y='18' width='164' height='72' rx='10' fill='var(--paper-2,#eef3f8)' stroke='var(--line,#c8d5e3)'/><text x='22' y='43' font-size='12' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>01</text><text x='90' y='69' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>历史参数与钻速</text><path d='M175 54h10l-4-4m4 4l-4 4' fill='none' stroke='#8295a6'/><rect x='188' y='18' width='164' height='72' rx='10' fill='var(--paper-2,#eef3f8)' stroke='var(--line,#c8d5e3)'/><text x='202' y='43' font-size='12' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>02</text><text x='270' y='69' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>480点拟合回归</text><path d='M355 54h10l-4-4m4 4l-4 4' fill='none' stroke='#8295a6'/><rect x='368' y='18' width='164' height='72' rx='10' fill='var(--paper-2,#eef3f8)' stroke='var(--line,#c8d5e3)'/><text x='382' y='43' font-size='12' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>03</text><text x='450' y='69' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>120点留出检查</text><path d='M535 54h10l-4-4m4 4l-4 4' fill='none' stroke='#8295a6'/><rect x='548' y='18' width='164' height='72' rx='10' fill='var(--paper-2,#eef3f8)' stroke='var(--line,#c8d5e3)'/><text x='562' y='43' font-size='12' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>04</text><text x='630' y='69' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>约束筛选与推荐</text></g></svg><div class='figcap'><b>方法路径</b><span>对数线性回归＋约束网格搜索：学习钻速响应，再筛选安全窗口内的高钻速组合。</span></div><p>示范采用可解释的经验模型骨架：在对数空间拟合共享的钻压指数 a、转速指数 b，以及各地层的截距。拟合前扣除程序已知的井底净化因子，使因子的影响不会被重复计入回归系数。</p><p>600 个样本按固定规则划分为 480 个训练点与 120 个验证点。随后枚举钻压、转速组合，过滤扭矩、当量密度与地层允许钻压约束不满足的点，再比较预测钻速。页面呈现的是模型计算过程，不包含设备执行或井场试点。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 130' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻速模型与参数寻优流水线'><g transform='translate(8,18)'><rect width='150' height='64' rx='8' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='75' y='28' font-size='11.5' font-weight='600' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>合成钻井参数</text><text x='75' y='47' font-size='9' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>600 点 · 三类地层</text></g><g transform='translate(196,18)'><rect width='150' height='64' rx='8' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='75' y='28' font-size='11.5' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>对数空间回归</text><text x='75' y='47' font-size='9' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>共享指数 + 地层截距</text></g><g transform='translate(384,18)'><rect width='150' height='64' rx='8' fill='#f6ebe1' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='75' y='28' font-size='11.5' font-weight='600' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>三重约束窗口</text><text x='75' y='47' font-size='9' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>扭矩 · ECD · 钻压</text></g><g transform='translate(572,18)'><rect width='140' height='64' rx='8' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='70' y='28' font-size='11.5' font-weight='600' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>模型候选参数</text><text x='70' y='47' font-size='9' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>网格枚举 · 教学对比</text></g><line x1='158' y1='50' x2='192' y2='50' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#arD1b)'/><line x1='346' y1='50' x2='380' y2='50' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#arD1b)'/><line x1='534' y1='50' x2='568' y2='50' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#arD1b)'/><defs><marker id='arD1b' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#9ba3a9'/></marker></defs><text x='360' y='110' font-size='10' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>图示为本地教学计算链，不连接井场设备</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>原理示意</b><span>本地示范从合成数据出发，完成模型拟合、独立验证点误差计算和约束筛选；这里的“独立”指不参加拟合的点，并非另一口真实井。</span></div>"
